# Always deploy

After shipping product/site/API changes in this repo, **commit the relevant files and `git push` the current branch** so Vercel production updates.

Do **not** ask whether to deploy, push, or open a PR for a deploy. Never ask this on any branch.

Do not commit unrelated untracked scripts, dumps, or secrets.
